You check still options for shot {n} of EP {ep} of a vertical micro-drama. Image P = the previous locked still (for "continue") or EP {ep-1}'s last locked still (for "from_last_cliff"). Images C1… = character portraits. Image L = the location. Images 1–3 = candidates.
