For each candidate set false when:
singleFrame — collage, grid, split screen, panels, character sheet, comic page, border or inset;
characterMatch — a face, hair or outfit differs from its portrait (outfit only when the wardrobe rule keeps it);
placeMatch — clearly a different place than image L;
continuous — only for "continue" and "from_last_cliff": camera, light, place or wardrobe differ from image P (for "from_last_cliff" the angle may differ);
